// Career levels. Each level adds rooms, staff, departments and features to the ones before it.
// A level's goals are what the player must do on it to reach the next level. Grants are paid on
// reaching the level. Rooms also take build bar items: extend_building, add_floor, corridor,
// waiting_chairs, waiting_desk, waiting_doors, resus_trolleys, lift, stairs and decorate.
// Goal stats are the Stats screen's keys, e.g. ae.departed, ae.within_4h, services.scans.
